<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="faq-layout">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-eye">Common questions</p>
        <h2 class="sec-h2">FAQ</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">Can't find the answer you need? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@goaustralia.co.nz" style="color:var(--amber);">hello@goaustralia.co.nz</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details>
          <summary>Is this a subscription?</summary>
          <div class="faq-ans">No. Full Access is a one-time payment of $24.99 NZD. You pay once and have access to everything — the full checklist, all three PDF guides, and the Suburb Finder — forever. No recurring charges.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What's included in Full Access?</summary>
          <div class="faq-ans">Full Access includes the complete 70-step interactive checklist (with state-specific versions for NSW, VIC, QLD, WA, SA), the Kiwi Masterguide PDF, the Tax &amp; Finance Guide PDF, the Australian Jobs Guide PDF, and access to the Suburb Finder tool. All content is updated regularly and you get free updates.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What do I get for free?</summary>
          <div class="faq-ans">The free version gives you the Visa Pathway Checker, the Move Cost Calculator, all blog articles, and the first 10 steps of the interactive checklist — enough to start your research and figure out your timeline. When you're ready to get serious about planning, upgrade for the full toolkit.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Is there a money-back guarantee?</summary>
          <div class="faq-ans">Yes. If you're not happy within 30 days, email hello@goaustralia.co.nz and we'll refund you in full. No questions asked.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Is this the official Australian Government site?</summary>
          <div class="faq-ans">No. GoAustralia.co.nz is an independent resource operated by Kiwis who have made the move themselves. We're not affiliated with the Australian or New Zealand government. We translate complex government policy into plain English. Always verify important decisions with official sources at homeaffairs.gov.au.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What's the difference between Full Access and buying a guide?</summary>
          <div class="faq-ans">The individual guides ($19–$27 each) give you just the PDF. Full Access at $24.99 includes all three PDFs plus the interactive 70-step checklist, the Suburb Finder, and account-based progress tracking. If you're actively planning a move, Full Access is significantly better value.</div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA BAND -->
<div class="cta-band">
  <div class="shell">
    <h2>Ready to make the move?</h2>
    <p>Join 12,400+ Kiwis who planned their move with GoAustralia. One payment of $24.99 NZD. No subscription.</p>
    <a href="/signup" class="cta-band-btn">Get Full Access — $24.99 NZD →</a>
  </div>
</div>

</Layout>
